<section>
    <h2>Features</h2>
    <ul class="features-list">
        <li><span class="feat-name">Manual tiling</span> — organize windows into horizontal, vertical, tabbed, or stacked layouts with full keyboard control</li>
        <li><span class="feat-name">Floating windows</span> — seamlessly mix floating and tiled windows in the same workspace</li>
        <li><span class="feat-name">Smooth animations</span> — window open/close, moves, resizes, and workspace transitions all animate out of the box</li>
        <li><span class="feat-name">WebAssembly plugin system</span> — extend and override core behavior without touching a line of C++</li>
        <li><span class="feat-name">i3/Sway-compatible IPC</span> — works with <code>swaymsg</code>, Waybar, and the rest of the ecosystem you already know</li>
        <li><span class="feat-name">Hot-reload config</span> — apply changes instantly with <code>Meta+Shift+R</code>, no restart required</li>
        <li><span class="feat-name">Multi-monitor support</span> — independent workspaces across outputs, fully configurable</li>
        <li><span class="feat-name">Accessibility built in</span> — magnifier, slow keys, sticky keys, and cursor configuration included</li>
    </ul>
</section>
